<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Bombay, Jan 2 - Berthing position at Kandla port as of Dec 20 - ten cargo vessels berthed alongside Kandla port, six oil vessels berthed alongside port, 12 cargo vessels and 10 oil vessels anchored off Kandla roads awaiting berth.</p>
</text>
